<title>USA: Unisys unit gets $200 mln NASA contract.</title>
<headline>Unisys unit gets $200 mln NASA contract.</headline>
<dateline>MCLEAN, Va. 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unisys Corp said Tuesday that its Federal Systems division has been awarded a $200 million contract from NASA for networking equipment.</p>
<p>Last month, Unisys received a NASA contract to provide general purpose workstations.</p>
<p>The latest contract is a fixed price, single award, indefinite delivery, indefinite quantity contract for one-year, with three one-year options.</p>
<p>The two contracts combined have a potential value of $250 million.</p>
</text>
